<title>USA: Batteries Batteries to acquire Cliffco.</title>
<headline>Batteries Batteries to acquire Cliffco.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Batteries Batteries Inc said it entered an agreement to acquire Cliffco Inc, a Florida-based cellular products distributor, for a combination of stock and cash.</p>
<p>A purchase price was not disclosed, but Cliffco's revenues would be less than 10 percent of Batteries Batteries revenues, which are expected to exceed $50 million with the recently announced deal to acquire Alexander Batteries, the company said.</p>
<p>Batteries Batteries held an initial public offering in April.</p>
